 python3-protobuf
Description: checkpoint and restore in userspace utilities and libraries
 CRIU checkpoints running applications and restores them later.
 .
 This package includes the criu executable, the crit image tool,
 Python bindings, headers, manual pages, and bundled plugins.

Package: criu-pin
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 criu (= ${binary:Version})
Description: APT pin to keep this CRIU build installed
 This package installs an APT preferences entry that pins CRIU to the
 exact version built from this source tree, so routine Ubuntu upgrades do
 not replace it with a newer archive build.
